    "bio": "Ziwen Chen is a Ph.D. student in Organizational Behavior at Stanford Graduate School of Business. She studies markets and cultures via computational tools such as big data analysis, natural language processing, and digital experiments. Before her Ph.D., she received an M.A. in Computational Social Science from the University of Chicago, and a B.S. in Geographic Information Science from Wuhan University.",
