      "bio_text": "Chris is the Osborne Postdoctoral Fellow in the Strategy Unit at UCLA\u2019s Anderson School of Management, where he is also associated with thePrice Center for Entrepreneurship and Innovation. He was previously a postdoctoral fellow at theMansueto Institute for Urban Innovationand theKnowledge Labat the University of Chicago. He received his Ph.D. from the UCLA Department of Geography in June 2021.",
