      "bio_text": "After moving to Seattle, I discovered my passion for snowboarding on the incredible slopes of the Pacific Northwest. What started as weekend adventures quickly evolved into a deeper commitment to the sport. I'm now a certified AASI Level 1 instructor, sharing the joy of snowboarding with others while continuing to push my own limits on the mountain.",
