    "email": "xiaodiyang@uchicago.edu",
    "institution": "University of Chicago",
    "bio": "Xiaodi Yang is a master's student in the Social Sciences Program at the University of Chicago. She uses language models to study how people form group cognition and ideologies through social contagion, with a focus on the role of digital media technologies in this process. She is also curious about the transformations in knowledge production brought about by AI technologies.\nBefore joining the University of Chicago, she earned her bachelor's degree in sociology from Xi'an Jiaotong University. Her undergraduate research primarily focused on social network relationships and interpersonal communication.\n",
