    "email": "paceves@jhu.edu",
    "institution": "Johns Hopkins University",
    "bio": "Pedro (Pete) Aceves is an Assistant Professor of Management and Organization at the Carey Business School at Johns Hopkins University. His research bridges multiple disciplinary domains, including organization theory, linguistics, cognitive science, and information theory. By linking these domains of scientific work with computational and natural language processing tools, he aims to bring a dynamic and interactional lens to the study of organizational and economic life. He is studying these themes in contexts ranging from small groups such as mountaineering expeditions and innovation teams to large-scale social systems such as online platforms, markets, and scientific disciplines.",
